    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Carol, thank you for your message. Two thigns:</div><div><br></div><div>1. Can you update to the latest version with install.packages(&quot;tidyLPA&quot;) (there&#39;s a small change in the latest version - that function should now be just estimate_profiles())</div><div><br></div><div>2. I think if you add the argument print_which_stats = &quot;all&quot; to the function, then the AIC should be returned; i.e., estimate_profiles(d, var1, var2, var3, n_profiles = 3, print_which_stats = &quot;all&quot;)<br></div><div><br></div><div>Let us know if this works!</div><div>Josh</div></div>"
    ],
