     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Friday, July 20, 2018 at 10:16:27 PM UTC-4, Joshua Rosenberg wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Carol, thank you for your message. Two thigns:</div><div><br></div><div>1. Can you update to the latest version with install.packages(&quot;tidyLPA&quot;) (there&#39;s a small change in the latest version - that function should now be just estimate_profiles())</div><div><br></div><div>2. I think if you add the argument print_which_stats = &quot;all&quot; to the function, then the AIC should be returned; i.e., estimate_profiles(d, var1, var2, var3, n_profiles = 3, print_which_stats = &quot;all&quot;)<br></div><div><br></div><div>Let us know if this works!</div><div>Josh</div><div><br></div>On Thursday, July 19, 2018 at 6:36:18 PM UTC-4, cwong17 wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"></p>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\nHello,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\nI am a 2nd year grad student, and I am currently running a data set using the tidyLPA package. I know that in the past, I was able to get the AIC values for specific models with the estimate_profiles_lpa command. But I went through the most updated reference\r\n manual and did not see anything on that. I am just wondering if that&#39;s something feasible currently with the tidyLPA package?</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\nThank you so much for your work on this!</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\nRegards,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16p